<doc id="171217" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=171217" title="Penampakan UFO ing Australia">
Penampakan UFO ing Australia

Pratélan iki minangka pratélan panemu sing diduga &lt;a href="obyek%20mabur%20sing%20ora%20dingerteni"&gt;obyek mabur sing ora dingerteni&lt;/a&gt; (UFO) ing &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>1960</h2>
<ul>
<li>Ing tanggal 19 Januari 1966, sawijining petani saka &lt;a href="Tully%2C%20Queensland"&gt;Tully, Queensland&lt;/a&gt; nglaporake ndeleng ana obyek berbentuk piring gedhe, lan uga diarani "sarang" alang-alang ing rawa ing panggonane UFO.</li>
<li>Udakara jam 10:30 esuk tanggal 6 April 1966, akeh siswa lan sawetara staf ing Westall High School (saiki diarani &lt;a href="Westall%20Secondary%20College"&gt;Westall Secondary College&lt;/a&gt;), ing Rosebank Avenue, &lt;a href="Clayton%20South%2C%20Victoria"&gt;Clayton South, Victoria&lt;/a&gt; nyekseni &lt;a href="Westall%20High%20School%20UFO"&gt;a UFO mabur ing sekolahe&lt;/a&gt;, banjur mudhun menyang ing mburine sekolah.</li>
</ul>
<h2>1970</h2>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Ilange%20Valentich"&gt;Ilange Valentich&lt;/a&gt; kedadeyan tanggal 21 Oktober 1978, nalika Frederick Valentich umur 20 taun ilang nalika pilot pesawat &lt;a href="Cessna%20182"&gt;Cessna 182&lt;/a&gt; pesawat liwat &lt;a href="Selat%20Bass"&gt;Selat Bass&lt;/a&gt; menyang &lt;a href="Pulo%20King%20%28Tasmania%29"&gt;Pulo King (Tasmania)&lt;/a&gt;. Diterangake minangka "penggemar piring terbang", Valentich, umur rong puluh taun, ngandhani kontrol lalu lintas udhara ing Melbourne manawa dheweke diiringi pesawat sing ora dingerteni.</li>
</ul>
<h2>1980</h2>
<ul>
<li>Ing tanggal 21 Januari 1988, ana kulawarga nglaporake kontak karo UFO nalika lelungan nyebrang &lt;a href="Nullarbor%20Plain"&gt;Nullarbor Plain&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Australia%20Kidul"&gt;Australia Kidul&lt;/a&gt;. Kulawarga nggambarake obyek kasebut minangka "bal sing gedhe".</li>
</ul>
<h2>1990</h2>
<ul>
<li>Ing tanggal 8 Agustus 1993, wanita [Melbourne] Kelly Cahill nglaporake ndeleng sawijining pakaryan gedhe nglayang ing dalan nalika dheweke lan bojone lumaku liwat &lt;a href="Dandenong%20Ranges"&gt;Dandenong Ranges&lt;/a&gt; cedhak &lt;a href="Belgrave%2C%20Victoria"&gt;Belgrave, Victoria&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
</ul>
