<doc id="171232" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=171232" title="Wungkus">
Wungkus

Wungkus yaiku sesuguh panganan sing digawe nganggo roti lapis sing lembut digulung sak isine.
Roti biasa yaiku tortilla gandum, lavash, utawa pita ; Isi biasané dumadi saka meat kadhemen ngiris, unggas, utawa iwak diiringi rajangan Lettuce, irisan tomat utawa Pico de Gallo, &lt;a href="Guacamol%C3%A9"&gt;guacamole&lt;/a&gt;, sauteed &lt;a href="Jamur%20pangan"&gt;jamur&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20bakon"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, garang &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="saos"&gt;saos&lt;/a&gt;, kaya ta ranch utawa &lt;a href="Mustar"&gt;madu sawi&lt;/a&gt;.

