Ngo hiang

Ngo hiang (Chinese), uga dikenal kanthi jeneng heh gerng (Chinese) utawa lor bak (Chinese) minangka olahan khas Hokkien lan Teochew sing akeh diadopsi ing &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt; (ing endi diarani kikiam,]), &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Tanah%20Thai"&gt;Thailand&lt;/a&gt; ; saliyane papan dununge ing &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Rakyat%20Cina"&gt;Tiongkok&lt;/a&gt; wetan.
