Lapis endhog

Lapis endhog minangka &lt;a href="sandwich"&gt;sandwich&lt;/a&gt; kanthi jinis isi endhog sing wis dimasak. &lt;a href="Endhog%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;Endhog goreng, endhog&lt;/a&gt; orak-arik, irisan endhog rebus lan salad endhog (campuran endhog masak lan mayonnaise sing wis disigar) minangka panganan sing populer. Ing kasus kaping papat, bisa uga diarani sandwich salad endhog.

