Pitik katsu

Pitik Katsu chicken cutlet (チキンカツ, chikinkatsu) (chicken cutlet (チキンカツ, chikinkatsu)), uga dikenal minangka pitik panko, utawa tori katsu ((鶏カツ, torikatsu)) yaiku sajian &lt;a href="Ayam%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;pitik goreng&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Masakan%20Jepang"&gt;Jepang sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe karo remah roti panko sing uga kawentar ing &lt;a href="Ostrali"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hawaii"&gt;Hawaii&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt;, lan wilayah liyane ing jagad iki. 
