<doc id="171802" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=171802" title="Baobing">
Baobing

Baobing (&lt;a href="basa%20Tionghoa"&gt;Tionghoa&lt;/a&gt;: 刨冰; &lt;a href="Pinyin"&gt;Pinyin&lt;/a&gt;: bàobīng), uga dikenal kanthi jeneng Hokkien Taiwane Tsuabing (&lt;a href="Hanzi%20Tradisional"&gt;Tradisional&lt;/a&gt;: 礤冰; &lt;a href="Pe%CC%8Dh-%C5%8De-j%C4%AB"&gt;Pe̍h-ōe-jī&lt;/a&gt;: chhoah-peng), minangka panganan mulut es sing digiling sing ditemokake ing China Raya lan negara-negara sing akeh populasi Cina ing jaban rangkah kayata &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;. Utamane misuwur ing &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Cina"&gt;Taiwan&lt;/a&gt;, sajian kasebut duwe jinis sing diarani xuehua bing (雪花 冰).
Panganan panganan cuci mulut kalebu gundukan gilingan es kanthi macem-macem topping ing ndhuwur. Macem-macem topping ana, nanging sing paling umum kalebu banyu gula, &lt;a href="Susu%20kondensasi"&gt;susu pekat&lt;/a&gt;, kacang adzuki, kacang &lt;a href="Kacang%20ijo"&gt;mung&lt;/a&gt;, lan baloka tapioka. Woh uga digunakake miturut musim. &lt;a href="Pelem"&gt;Pelem&lt;/a&gt; baobing mung kasedhiya ing mangsa panas, dene baobing stroberi kasedhiya ing mangsa adhem.
