<doc id="171838" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=171838" title="Soppressata">
Soppressata

Soppressata minangka &lt;a href="salami"&gt;salami&lt;/a&gt; garing saka Italia. Sanajan ana maneka jinis, ana rong jinis utama sing digawe: sosis garing sing wis diobati khas &lt;a href="Basilicata"&gt;Basilicata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puglia"&gt;Apulia&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Calabria"&gt;Calabria&lt;/a&gt;, lan salame sing ora bisa diatasi kanthi beda, digawe ing &lt;a href="Toscana"&gt;Tuscany&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Liguria"&gt;Liguria&lt;/a&gt;. Isih kalebu bagean saka &lt;a href="warisan%20budaya"&gt;warisan budaya&lt;/a&gt; Italia kidul sing masarakat lokal (utamane ing kutha-kutha padesan sing luwih cilik) nyembelih babi kasebut lan nggunakake kabeh, kanthi ora ana sampah, nggunakake sawetara bagean kanggo nggawe daging sing wis mari kalebu soppressata. Kadhangkala Soppressata disiapake migunakake ham. 
