<doc id="171839" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=171839" title="Babi uyah">
Babi uyah

Uyah daging babi iku &lt;a href="Ger%C3%A8h"&gt;uyah-nambani&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;. Biasane disiapake saka &lt;a href="Weteng%20babi"&gt;weteng daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, utawa, luwih asring, fatback. Salt daging babi biasane meh padha karing papan &lt;a href="Daging%20bakon"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, nanging fattier, kang digawe saka sisih paling wetenge, saltier, minangka tamba kuwat lan dileksanakake kanggo maneh, lan ora garang.
