Pljeskavica (Serbian Cyrillic,]), minangka salah sawijining sajian panggang daging Spiced &lt;a href="Patty"&gt;Patty&lt;/a&gt; dicampur daging babi, daging sapi lan wedhus iku panganan nasional &lt;a href="S%C3%A8rbi"&gt;Serbia&lt;/a&gt;, uga misuwur ing &lt;a href="Monten%C3%A9gro"&gt;Montenegro&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bosnia%20lan%20H%C3%A8rc%C3%A9govina"&gt;Bosnia lan Herzegovina&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kroasia"&gt;Kroasia&lt;/a&gt;. Iki minangka kursus utama &lt;a href="Kaymak"&gt;disedhiyakake&lt;/a&gt; karo bawang, &lt;a href="Kaymak"&gt;kajmak&lt;/a&gt; (krim susu), ajvar (relish), lan urnebes (salad keju pedhes), ing piring lan piring, utawa karo lepinja (roti lapis, saka &lt;a href="hamburger"&gt;hamburger&lt;/a&gt;). Bubar iki, Pljeskavica wis misuwur ing papan liya ing &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa"&gt;Eropa&lt;/a&gt; lan dilayani ing sawetara restoran panganan cepat saji khusus ing &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swèdhen&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Ostenrik"&gt;Ostenrik&lt;/a&gt;. Varieties kalebu " &lt;a href="Leskovac"&gt;Leskovac&lt;/a&gt; Pljeskavica" (Leskovačka pljeskavica) banget pedhes karo bawang, " &lt;a href="Gunung%20%C5%A0ar"&gt;Šar&lt;/a&gt; Pljeskavica" (Šarska pljeskavica) diiseni karo kačkavalj keju, " Hajduk Pljeskavica" (Hajdučka pljeskavica) saka daging sapi pipis daging babi garang, lan " &lt;a href="Vranje"&gt;Vranje&lt;/a&gt; Pljeskavica" (Vranjanska pljeskavica).
'Leskovac Pljeskavica' minangka merek Serbia.
