<doc id="171919" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=171919" title="Manti">
Manti

Manti (basa, &lt;a href="basa%20Basa%20Turki"&gt;Basa Turki&lt;/a&gt;: mantı, &lt;a href="Basa%20Basa%20Uzb%C3%A8k"&gt;Basa Uzbèk&lt;/a&gt;: manti, monti, &lt;a href="Basa%20Arm%C3%A8ni"&gt;Armèni&lt;/a&gt;: մանթի), uga manty (; &lt;a href="Basa%20Rusia"&gt;Rusia&lt;/a&gt;: манты ; #ALIH), Mantu (Pashto, &lt;a href="Basa%20Dari"&gt;Dari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Basa%20P%C3%A8rsi"&gt;Persia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: منتو‎‎ ; &lt;a href="basa%20Basa%20Tajik"&gt;Basa Tajik&lt;/a&gt;: манту) utawa manta (&lt;a href="Basa%20Uyghur"&gt;Basa Uyghur&lt;/a&gt;: مانتا‎ minangka olahan sajinis pangsit. Iki digawe saka daging giling lan bumbu.
Saka eneng kasebut, gumantung saka basa kasebut, bisa nuduhake dumpling tunggal utawa luwih saka siji pangsit sekaligus; ing basa Inggris, asring digunakake minangka wujud tunggal lan jamak.

