<doc id="171920" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=171920" title="Mi godhog">
Mi godhog

Mie godhog, secara harfiah " sup &lt;a href="Mi"&gt;mie&lt;/a&gt; ", utawa uga sinebut kanthi jeneng mie rebus / mi rebus (ejaan basa Indonesia) utawa mee rebus (ejaan Malaysia lan Singapura), kanthi harfiah "mie rebus", minangka sajian &lt;a href="Sop%20mi"&gt;sup mie&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Masakan%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;, lan populer ing negara-negara Asia Kidul-Wétan Maritim kayata &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt;.
