<doc id="171923" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=171923" title="Saos jagung">
Saos jagung

Saos jagung minangka cuweran campuran &lt;a href="Asem%20amino"&gt;asam amino&lt;/a&gt; sing terikat, asam organik lan uyah, produk reaksi Maillard, lan &lt;a href="mineral"&gt;mineral&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="%C3%89valuasi%20s%C3%A9nsori"&gt;Analisis sensori&lt;/a&gt; nggambarake saos jagung kanthi &lt;a href="Gurih"&gt;rasa gurih&lt;/a&gt; khas kalebu 'xian' (鲜 ing basa Cina), &lt;a href="Gurih"&gt;umami&lt;/a&gt;, karamel, panggang, rada &lt;a href="Khamir"&gt;ragi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gurih"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Uyah"&gt;asin&lt;/a&gt;, lan legi.
