<doc id="171926" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=171926" title="Mug">
Mug

Mug minangka sawijining￼￼ jinis cangkir sing biasane digunakake kanggo ngombe minuman panas, kayata &lt;a href="kopi"&gt;kopi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Soklat%20panas"&gt;coklat panas&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="T%C3%A8h"&gt;teh&lt;/a&gt;. Mug biasane duwe gagang lan nahan cuweran sing luwih gedhe tinimbang jinis cangkir liyane. Biasane, mug ngemot udakara 8 – cairan. A bodo gaya kurang formal saka &lt;a href="Omb%C3%A8n-omb%C3%A8n"&gt;ngombe&lt;/a&gt; wadhah lan ora biasane digunakake ing formal setelan Panggonan, ngendi &lt;a href="Cangkir"&gt;teacup&lt;/a&gt; utawa warung tuwung disenengi. Cukur cukur digunakake kanggo mbantu nyukur teles.
