Sup mie daging sapi yaiku salah sawinining olahan sup &lt;a href="Sop%20mi"&gt;mi sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Godhogan"&gt;rebus&lt;/a&gt; utawa abang &lt;a href="Godhogan"&gt;rebus&lt;/a&gt;, duduh kaldu daging sapi, &lt;a href="Janganan"&gt;jangan&lt;/a&gt; lan mi Cina. Ana ing macem-macem wujud ing saindenging &lt;a href="Asia%20Kidul-w%C3%A9tan"&gt;Asia&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Asia%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Wétan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Asia%20Kidul-w%C3%A9tan"&gt;Tenggara&lt;/a&gt;. Sup mi mi kaldu sing bening kasebut diduga diciptakake dening masarakat &lt;a href="Wong%20Hui"&gt;Hui&lt;/a&gt; sajrone &lt;a href="wangsa%20Tang"&gt;wangsa Tang&lt;/a&gt; lan umume dikenal minangka sup mi sapi Lanzhou. Sup mi daging sapi Sichuan utawa sup mi daging sapi abang (紅燒 牛肉 麵) pisanan digawe dening para veteran &lt;a href="Kuomintang"&gt;Kuomintang&lt;/a&gt; ing Taiwan; variasi iki dadi umum dikenal minangka sup mi sapi Taiwan.
