Sop mami

Mami minangka salah sawijining￼￼ olahan &lt;a href="Sop%20mi"&gt;sup mi mi&lt;/a&gt; Filipina sing digawe &lt;a href="Mi"&gt;mie&lt;/a&gt; tepung gandum, duduh kaldu lan tambahan daging (&lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;) utawa &lt;a href="Wonton"&gt;pangsit wonton&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Pancit"&gt;Yaiku&lt;/a&gt; jinis &lt;a href="pancit"&gt;pancit&lt;/a&gt;.

