Wiener schnitzel

Wiener schnitzel ([ˈviːnɐ ˈʃnɪtsl̩] ; saka pocapan: Jerman Wiener Schnitzel 'Chaplin cutlet'), dieja Wienerschnitzel, minangka ing Switserlan, iku olahan jinis schnitzel digawe saka lancip, &lt;a href="Panir"&gt;breaded&lt;/a&gt;, pan-goreng &lt;a href="Daging%20sapi%20enom"&gt;veal&lt;/a&gt; cutlet.
