<doc id="172109" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172109" title="Chapati">
Chapati

Chapati (utawa cara liyane dieja chapatti, chappati, chapathi, utawa chappathi ; diucapake minangka &lt;a href="IAST"&gt;IAST&lt;/a&gt;: #ALIH), uga dikenal minangka roti, safati, shabaati, phulka lan (ing &lt;a href="Malad%C3%A9wa"&gt;Maladewa&lt;/a&gt;) roshi, minangka roti rata tanpa ragi saka sub bawana India lan pokok ing &lt;a href="Indhi"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="N%C3%A9pal"&gt;Nepal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Banggalad%C3%A9sa"&gt;Bangladesh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pakistan"&gt;Pakistan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="C%C3%A8ylon"&gt;Sri Lanka&lt;/a&gt;, Afrika Wétan lan &lt;a href="Karibia"&gt;Karibia&lt;/a&gt;. Chapatis digawe saka glepung gandum sing dikenal minangka atta, dicampur adonan karo banyu, &lt;a href="Lenga%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;minyak&lt;/a&gt; lan uyah miturut kasenengan ing piranti campuran sing diarani parat, lan dimasak ing tava (wajan rata). 
