Roti Markook, uga dikenal kanthi khubz Ruqaq, shrak, khubz rqeeq,   mashrooh (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: مرقوق, شراك, مشروح, خبز رقيق, خبز رقاق) yaiku olahan sajinis Eastern Tengah Tanpa Ragi flatbread umum ing &lt;a href="Levant"&gt;Levant&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ujung%20Arab"&gt;semenanjung Arab&lt;/a&gt;. Iki dipanggang ing wadhah logam cembung (saj) utawa ing tannour. 
