<doc id="172203" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172203" title="Mayonès">
Mayonès

Mayonnaise, mayo informal, minangka sawijining &lt;a href="Saos"&gt;saus&lt;/a&gt; adhem kenthel utawa &lt;a href="Salad"&gt;klamben sing&lt;/a&gt; biasa digunakake ing &lt;a href="sandwich"&gt;sandwich&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="hamburger"&gt;hamburger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Salad"&gt;salad kasusun&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Kenthang%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;kentang goreng&lt;/a&gt;. Iki uga bisa dadi dhasar kanggo saos liyane, kaya ta &lt;a href="Saos%20tartar"&gt;saus tartar&lt;/a&gt;, remoulade, golf salsa lan rouille.
Iki kasusun saka campuran &lt;a href="Lenga%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;minyak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kuning%20endhog"&gt;kuning telur&lt;/a&gt;, lan asam, cuka utawa &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;jus lemon&lt;/a&gt; ; ana macem-macem jinis nggunakake rasa tambahan. Werna mayonnaise beda-beda wiwit putih cedhak nganti kuning pucet, lan teksture saka &lt;a href="Krim%20%28omb%C3%A8nan%29"&gt;krim&lt;/a&gt; entheng nganti gel sing kandel.
Saos iki ana sing digawe komersial kanggo vegan lan sing ora &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog pitik&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Kolesterol"&gt;kolesterol diet&lt;/a&gt; uga wong sing &lt;a href="Al%C3%A9rgi%20endhog"&gt;alergi endhog&lt;/a&gt;.
