<doc id="172358" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172358" title="Pajéon">
Pajéon

Pajéon (파전,]) minangka macem-macem &lt;a href="jeon"&gt;jeon&lt;/a&gt; kanthi daun bawang minangka bahan utama, kayata pa (파) tegese &lt;a href="Loncang"&gt;scallion&lt;/a&gt;. Iki minangka panganan Korea sing digawe saka adonan &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="glepung"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt; gandum, &lt;a href="glepung"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Glepung%20beras"&gt;beras&lt;/a&gt;, daun bawang, lan asring bahan-bahan liyane gumantung saka macem-macem. &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;Daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kimchi"&gt;kimchi&lt;/a&gt;, kerang, lan &lt;a href="Tetedhan%20seganten"&gt;panganan laut&lt;/a&gt; liyane biasane digunakake. Yen salah sawijining bahan, kayata &lt;a href="Juwi"&gt;cumi-cumi&lt;/a&gt;, dominasi jeneng kasebut, jeneng kasebut bakal nggambarake; ojing'eo jeon (오징어 전) yaiku 'squid jeon'.
Pajeon biasane bisa dingerteni karo scallion sing katon banget. Mirip karo &lt;a href="Cong%20you%20bing"&gt;pancake scallion&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Masakan%20Cinten"&gt;Cina&lt;/a&gt; nanging ora tekstur ora kandhel lan ora digawe saka adonan. 
