Krim marshmallow

Marshmallow creme (uga disebut marshmallow fluff, kuwi marshmallow, marshmallow panyebaran, utawa marshmallow tempel) punika &lt;a href="marshmallow"&gt;marshmallow&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kembang%20manisan"&gt;kitha&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Nyebar%20%28panganan%29"&gt;panyebaran&lt;/a&gt; padha ing roso, nanging ora tektur, kanggo marshmallow ngalangi biasa. Salah sawijining merek creme marshmallow yaiku Marshmallow Fluff, sing digunakake kanggo nggawe &lt;a href="Olahan%20omahan"&gt;panganan kenyamanan&lt;/a&gt; klasik New England, &lt;a href="Fluffernutter"&gt;sandwich fluffernutter&lt;/a&gt;, sing debut ing taun 1918 ing Massachusetts, mung setaun sawise creme marshmallow ditemokake. Iki diprodhuksi dening Durkee-Mower, Inc. bahan-bahané kalebu sirup jagung, sirup &lt;a href="Sirup"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt;, rasa vanila, lan &lt;a href="putih%20endhog"&gt;putih endhog&lt;/a&gt;. 
