<doc id="172438" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172438" title="Proja">
Proja

Proja (&lt;a href="Alfab%C3%A8t%20Kiril"&gt;Sirilik&lt;/a&gt;: Проја,]) yaiku sajian &lt;a href="Balkan"&gt;Balkan sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka &lt;a href="S%C3%A9real%20jagung"&gt;glepung jagung&lt;/a&gt;, bubuk manggang, &lt;a href="Lenga%20kembang%20sreng%C3%A9ng%C3%A9"&gt;minyak bunga matahari&lt;/a&gt;, banyu lan &lt;a href="Uyah"&gt;uyah sing&lt;/a&gt; mencorong. Proha minangka jeneng alternatif sing digunakake ing &lt;a href="Bosnia%20lan%20H%C3%A8rc%C3%A9govina"&gt;Bosnia lan Herzegovina&lt;/a&gt;.Biyen kondhang nalika mlarat, biasane sadurunge taun 1950an, nanging saiki dadi panganan umum. Asring disalahpahami karo projara, varian proja sing rada fancier, sing kalebu bahan tambahan tepung, endhog lan yogurt.

