Ing NASCAR Larson gabung karo tim &lt;a href="Chip%20Ganassi%20Racing"&gt;Chip Ganassi Racing&lt;/a&gt; wiwit musim 2014 nganti 2020. Wiwit taun 2021, dhèwèké gabung karo tim &lt;a href="Hendrick%20Motorsports"&gt;Hendrick Motorsports&lt;/a&gt;.
