Bola babi minangka bagean umum saka masakan &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Cina"&gt;Taiwan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Rakyat%20Cina"&gt;China&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt; lan bagean liyane ing Asia, kalebu &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Bali"&gt;Bali&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tanah%20Thai"&gt;Thailand&lt;/a&gt;. Dheweke misuwur banget ing kutha &lt;a href="Hsinchu"&gt;Hsinchu&lt;/a&gt; ing Taiwan, ing festival kasebut diwenehake kanggo dheweke. Jeneng kasebut asale saka basa &lt;a href="Minnan%20Taiwan"&gt;Taiwanese&lt;/a&gt;:摃(kanggo pon karo mallet) +丸(bal). Nanging, paraga pertama biasane diarani貢(pajeg, hadiah) amarga pocapan basa Mandarin sing luwih cocog karo pocapan ese ing &lt;a href="Minnan%20Taiwan"&gt;Taiwan&lt;/a&gt;.
