<doc id="172627" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172627" title="Jeruk limau">
Jeruk limau

A jeruk (saka &lt;a href="Basa%20Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt; jeruk, saka &lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt; Lima, saka &lt;a href="Basa%20P%C3%A8rsi"&gt;Persia&lt;/a&gt; līmū, "linglang") iku &lt;a href="Sitrus"&gt;jeuk&lt;/a&gt; woh, kang biasane babak, ijo ing warna, 3 – &lt;a href="Dhiam%C3%A8ter"&gt;diameteripun&lt;/a&gt;, lan ngemot vesikel jus &lt;a href="Asem"&gt;asam&lt;/a&gt;. Ana sawetara jinis wit jeruk sing woh-wohan diarani jeruk, kalebu jeruk Key (Citrus aurantiifolia), jeruk nipis Persia, jeruk kaffir, lan jeruk gurun. Jeruk nipis minangka sumber vitamin C sing akeh, asem, lan asring digunakake kanggo aksen rasa panganan lan omben-omben. Dheweke thukul taun. Tanduran kanthi woh sing diarani "jeruk nipis" duwe asal-usul genetik sing beda-beda; jeruk nipis ora dadi klompok monofletik.
