<doc id="172665" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172665" title="Pepperette">
Pepperette

Mrica minangka &lt;a href="Pangan"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; kaya &lt;a href="sosis"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt; sing biasane digawe saka &lt;a href="Daging%20giling"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Iwak%20kalkun"&gt;rebus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iwak%20kalkun"&gt;kalkun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; minangka varietas sing paling umum. Daging biasane dicampur karo rempah-rempah lan siap dipangan tanpa ana jinis masak utawa nyiapake. Lada bisa uga ora kudu didinginkan liwat jinis tartamtu lan cara nggawe.Pepperette bisa duwe macem-macem bentuk lan ukuran, nanging jinis sing paling umum meh padha karo segawon panas sing sempit.

