Dacquoise

dacquoise (Basa]) yaiku salah sawijining olahan &lt;a href="Bolu"&gt;kue&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bolu"&gt;cuci&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;mulut sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe lapisan almond lan kemiri &lt;a href="meringue"&gt;meringue&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Krim%20kocok"&gt;krim&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Krim%20kocok"&gt;krim&lt;/a&gt; butter ing dhasar biskuit mentega. 
