<doc id="172767" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172767" title="Dominostein">
Dominostein

A Dominostein (jamak Dominosteine, dipuntegesi &lt;a href="Domino"&gt;Domino kothak&lt;/a&gt;) punika olahan manis utamané didol sak mangsa Natal ing Jerman lan Ostenrik.

